sequenceDiagram
 box rgb(255,246,236) MegaMoE Native / Kernel
  participant V as megaflux_device.py
  participant P as moonep_planner.py
  participant W as mega_moe_bf16_replica.cpp
  participant K as mega_moe_moonep_planner.cpp
  participant D as mega_moe_replica_planner_control.cpp
  participant A as mega_moe_moonep_algorithm.h
  participant C as execution_plan_device.py
  participant L as mega_moe_plan_validator.cpp
 end
 V->>V: P01 create_plan：epoch++ / 固定原 stream / 校验 ids 与 capacity
 V->>P: P02 planner.plan(context)
 P->>W: P03 workspace.online_plan_moonep(shmem, ids, epoch, 输出buffers, capacity)
 W->>W: online_plan_impl(..., algorithm=-2)；校验拓扑与输出buffer
 W->>K: P04 dlopen planner SO；dlsym mega_moe_moonep_planner_do；当前stream入队
 Note over K,D: P12 编译 include，宏改名复用 control 实现
 D->>D: P13 每rank统计路由 / 汇总EP计数
 D->>A: P14 Run：按owner余量分配quota，再决定专家副本
 A-->>D: 份额 q 与 copies
 D->>D: P15 路由映射：按来源前缀与quota确定 physical_ids
 K-->>W: 同一 stream 写 copies / physical / logical / assignment / native_header
 W-->>P: 返回已提交的工作；此处不等于全设备完成
 P->>C: P05 validator.validate(context, copies, physical_ids, native_header)
 C->>C: P06 clone logical / physical / copies，建立本次计划快照
 C->>W: P07 validate_plan_local(..., epoch, capacity)
 W->>L: P16 本地校验 kernel：生成 packed 摘要
 W-->>C: 本地校验已入队
 C->>C: P08 dist.all_gather_into_tensor(gathered, packed, group=EP)
 Note over C: HCCL 收集全 EP 摘要；不是搬运专家完整权重
 C->>W: P09 validate_plan_global(gathered, native_header, reduced, header, ...)
 W->>L: P17 全局校验 kernel：消费EP摘要 / 写控制header
 W-->>C: 全局校验已入队
 C-->>P: P10 certified plan：logical_ids / physical_ids / copies / counts / header
 P-->>V: checked plan
 V->>V: P11 记录 tensor 版本 / 指针 / capacity；pending=True
 Note over V,C: 计算核校验 header / epoch / capacity；整网主路径同stream消费，不逐层读回状态
